      "text": "[1:17PM] #AgegeMotorRd #TrafficUpdate \n\nIyana Dopemu underneath bridge inward Mangoro is looking. \n\nIt's steady movement from Mangoro to Ile-zik, Ile-zik connecting Sule junction is looking good and traffic light alternation delay at Ile-zik. \n\nStill high influx from Ile-zik inward Ikeja and National as a result of broken down containerized Mack truck apprehended by Police officers but it has been towed out of the the road. \n\nIt's cool ride after National down to Bolade intersection, only slight delays at traffic light points. \n\nThe return journey is still in perfect shape.",
